# Scenario: a boss from its introduction through its defeat, its rewards and the progression it sets (M11.1a,
# docs/M11_PLAN.md section 18): temple 1's guardian, its arena entered the game's way (`boss temple1`: its defeat
# flags cleared, the arena's own event introduces it), its lines answered; the fight -- `devfight`: the nearest of
# the game's own ENEMY actors (the snake's head and its six segments) walked to and struck with the sword -- until
# the game sets the defeat flag (6); the money it drops and the life vessel its script places at its grid (13, 10)
# walked over (`devcollect`); the north passage (the door script's map change to the sage's room, D_1_3);
# the sage's event paged through until the game sets the orb's flag (7). No death on (the tools'): the snake's
# contact damage never ends the run. tests/devtools_suite.py checks the flags, the life, the money and the items.
# Starts from: the kept checkpoint dungeon1-boss-door (the hero with the dungeon's items, five hearts).
#! saves build/checkpoints/dungeon1-boss-door
#! env DOTHEROES_DEVELOPER_MODE=1 DOTHEROES_NATIVE_CD=1 DOTHEROES_NATIVE_SOLVER=1,2,4,5,6 GCM_WRAP_LAP=1
#! env DOTHEROES_PRESENT_ONCE=1 DOTHEROES_DEV_STATE=1 DIAG_FRAMES=frames.log PS3_VERBOSE=0 SHOT_EVERY=0
#! secs 1800

include common.drive

log TitleMovie 120
sleep 5
call continue
state life>0 90
sleep 3
dev nodeath on
dev player
dev flags 0 100
dev items
dev boss temple1 @150
sleep 2
shot arena
loop 30                       # the introduction: its lines wait for a button
  press CROSS
  sleep 1.5
end
devstate event_state==0 60
shot fight
segment fight temple 1's guardian to its defeat
devfight 1500 flag6
endseg
shot defeated
devcollect 180                # at once (dropped money does not stay): the money and the life vessel
dev flags 0 100
loop 6                        # whatever the defeat says
  press CROSS
  sleep 1.5
end
devcollect 60                 # the vessel, should it come after the money
sleep 2
loop 6                        # the vessel's message
  press CROSS
  sleep 1.5
end
dev player
shot vessel
goto 20.8 -4.0 0.6 30         # the north passage: the door script's map change to the sage's room
cross UP any 20
sleep 3
dev status
shot sage-room
segment cinematic the sage's event
loop 40
  press CROSS
  sleep 1.5
end
devstate flag7==1 120
endseg
sleep 3
shot after-sage
dev flags 0 100
dev items
dev player
dev progress
